		{
			description: [
				"Welcome to the Journeymen's Expansion; a modpack focused on providing a wide array of experiences and progesion lines to diversify player experience (As well as player builds to spice up pvp). Because of this no play through will be exactly the same."
				""
				"You may already know how to get started in minecraft; but I highly encourage you to check out and update keybinds to your preference."
				""
				"Most items are locked behind a skill cap; do not worry, XP comes quickly to those who search. To upgrade skills press G to open the Skills Menu!!!"
			]
