			dependencies: ["1E5D65ADE5C4092A"]
			description: [
				"Early on there are two things that you will need to keep an eye; food and temperature."
				""
				"Food in this modpack is a driving force behind many of my favorite tested endgame builds and can help you take on more difficult content earlier on than you might expect. Collect any and all seeds and food as you go."
				""
				"Temperature while not game breaking can be quite the hassel; similar to food there are ways to abuse the temperature system to really ramp up your damage. In the mean time though it will be a bit more of test. Water will help you to cool off and armor may insulate you from the cold."
				""
				"Best to moving; as the seasons change you may find summer poses more challenges than you may expect..."
			]
