		{
			dependencies: ["1E5D65ADE5C4092A"]
			description: [
				"Features mentioned here will be broken down further in other quest lines; however a quick run down of popular mods and where they fit into the pack."
				""
				"We have Alexs Caves with some of the most endgame materials being accessible only through the depths of your world."
				""
				"Ice and Fire; while only in beta I am sure the Sea Serpents would be more than happy to introduce you to the ocean."
				""
				"Apotheosis; literally the only thing I kept was the enchanting module as without item ids being fully integrated I was not able to properly balance other features. And if the enchanting set up is confusing do not worry; I will be here to help further down the quest lines."
				""
				"Better End and Better Nether; integrating these large fabric mods has been the back bone of this modpack. The entire reason it exists is to have the large variety of beautiful Nether and End biomes on forge."
				""
				"Terralith; my favorite world gen mod."
				""
				"Cataclysm; a staple of any modern modpack."
				""
				"Irons Spellbooks; because magic..... And maybe something is coming in the future for a particular Cyromancer Set....."
			]
